---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Projects · Shunkai Xu" page="projects">
<style is:inline slot="head">
.tempo{padding-block:var(--s6)}
.tempo .cols{align-items:end}
.tempo h2{grid-column:1/8;font-size:clamp(29px,3.2vw,47px)}
.tempo > .cols > p{grid-column:8/13;color:var(--ink-2)}
.tbox{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,5fr) minmax(0,7fr);gap:var(--s6);align-items:center;margin-top:var(--s5);border-top:1px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);padding-block:var(--s5)}
.dial{width:min(100%,400px);aspect-ratio:1;justify-self:center;touch-action:none;cursor:grab;outline:none}
.dial:active{cursor:grabbing}
.dial svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}
.dial .face{fill:var(--sheet);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1}
.dial .tk{stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1}
.dial .tk.mn{stroke:var(--rule)}
.dial .lb{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;fill:var(--muted);text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:central}
.dial .wedge{fill:var(--orange)}
.dial .knob{fill:var(--paper);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5}
.dial .hub{fill:var(--ink)}
.dial:focus-visible .face{stroke:var(--blue);stroke-width:2}
.read{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:clamp(64px,9vw,132px);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.read small{display:block;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:var(--s3)}
.tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--s2);margin-top:var(--s4);align-items:center}
.tools + .tools{margin-top:var(--s2)}
.tlog{margin-top:var(--s5);color:var(--muted)}
.tlog b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}
@media (max-width:860px){.tempo h2,.tempo > .cols > p{grid-column:1/-1}.tempo > .cols > p{margin-top:var(--s3)}.tbox{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--s5)}}
</style>

<main id="main" class="wrap page">
  <div class="head">
    <span class="fig mono">Sheet 2 / Projects</span>
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p>Two iPhone apps in progress, the code behind the robot arm on the home page, and a few smaller things.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="spec">
    <li><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Kept</span><span class="d">A privacy-first journal for iPhone. SwiftUI, SwiftData, HealthKit, widgets, Apple Watch and App Intents.</span><span class="m">In development</span></li>
    <li><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Tempo</span><span class="d">A focus timer for iPhone. SwiftUI. There's a working web version below.</span><span class="m">In development</span></li>
    <li><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Drawing arm</span><span class="d">The UR5e on the home page: real joint geometry, inverse kinematics solved every frame, pen strokes planned with smooth acceleration.</span><span class="m">three.js</span></li>
    <li><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Card-counting trainer</span><span class="d">A web app for practising blackjack counts against the clock.</span><span class="m">Web</span></li>
    <li><span class="n">05</span><span class="t">Hold'em simulator</span><span class="d">Plays out thousands of poker hands to estimate equity.</span><span class="m">Simulation</span></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="rule" data-chord="2"><span class="tick">§ 4</span></div>

  <section class="tempo" id="tempo">
    <div class="cols"><h2>Try Tempo</h2><p>The timer from my iPhone app, rebuilt for the web. Drag the dial to set the time, or pick a preset. It keeps running if you leave the page, and it counts what you finish today.</p></div>
    <div class="tbox">
      <div class="dial" id="dial" role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="Timer length in minutes" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuemax="60" aria-valuenow="25"><svg viewBox="-200 -200 400 400" id="dsvg"></svg></div>
      <div>
        <div class="read" aria-live="off"><small id="tmode">Focus</small><span id="tread">25:00</span></div>
        <div class="tools" role="group" aria-label="Presets">
          <button class="btn on" type="button" data-pre="25" data-name="Focus" aria-pressed="true">Focus 25</button>
          <button class="btn" type="button" data-pre="5" data-name="Break" aria-pressed="false">Break 5</button>
          <button class="btn" type="button" data-pre="45" data-name="Cello practice" aria-pressed="false">Cello practice 45</button>
        </div>
        <div class="tools">
          <button class="btn" type="button" id="tgo">Start</button>
          <button class="btn" type="button" id="treset">Reset</button>
        </div>
        <p class="tlog mono" id="tlog" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
import '../scripts/site.js';
import '../scripts/projects.js';
</script>
</Layout>
